        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: N.y.d.c. Café & Restaurants\n- Places: Singapore, Mississippi, United States\n- Products: Mississippi mud pie\n- Foods: soups, breads, pastas, pizzas, cookies, pies, ice cream, cheesecakes, cakes\n\nFacts:\n- N.y.d.c. Café & Restaurants is a restaurant chain based in Singapore.\n- N.y.d.c. Café & Restaurants serves homemade-style soups, breads, pastas, pizzas, cookies, pies, ice cream, mud pies, cheesecakes, and special cakes based on recipes from the founder’s family.\n- Mississippi mud pie is a chocolate-based dessert pie.\n- Mississippi mud pie likely originated in the U.S. state of Mississippi.",
